### OrderFlow API - request collection
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login as admin (copy the token into @token below)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@orderflow.dev", "password": "Admin123!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard KPIs
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products (search + low stock)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=usb&sortBy=stock&order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Low-stock products only
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?lowStock=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create product
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "ACC-010", "name": "USB Cable", "price": 9.99, "stock": 50, "category": "Accessories" }

### Update stock and price
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": 25, "price": 37.90 }

### Orders filtered by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Order detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create order (deducts stock in a transaction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Grace Lee",
  "customerEmail": "grace@example.com",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 4, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Update order status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Shipped" }
